 "description": "Developed by passionate designers for those who love the sea, the Lagoon 55 is a catamaran with a distinctive allure.  The perfect blend of Lagoon’s heritage and contemporary design, her sinuous lines make this catamaran instantly recognizable.",
 "credits": [
  {
   "label": "Interior design",
   "value": "Nauta Design"
  }
 ],
 "awards": [
  "The British Yachting Awards 2021 - Winner of the Multihull of the Year Award",
  "Oceanway China Yacht Award 2021 - Best sailing catamaran over 50 feet"
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "highlights",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Highlights",
   "intro": "",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "STRENGTH AND QUALITY",
     "text": "With bold, contemporary lines, the Lagoon 55 plays with the codes, combining innovation with the fundamentals of the brand’s heritage.  This subtle blend graces this new model with a contemporary silhouette, and sets a new milestone, in terms of design."
    },
    {
     "title": "TURNED TOWARD THE EXTERIOR",
     "text": "Designed as a true terrace on the water, the aft cockpit of the Lagoon 55 offers an incomparable view of the sea.  New architectural design solutions enabled the rearrangement of space on the aft transom in order to reinvent the flow of movement and life on board."
    },
    {
     "title": "THE ART OF COMFORT",
     "text": "Aboard the Lagoon 55, la dolce vita takes place far from the constraints of daily life.  Vast interior spaces have been designed for you to escape, to unwind, and to savor moments suspended in time.  This haven of well-being welcomes you with full comfort and privacy."
    },
    {
     "title": "Smart boat",
     "text": "With Seanapps, your Lagoon also accompanies you on your smartphone.\nThanks to the mobile app and its on-board unit, you can monitor the status of the main systems on board remotely: battery charge levels, fuel and water tank levels, or even the planning of maintenance operations.\nTo assist you when planning your journey and help you make the most of every trip, Seanapps also lets you plan your routes and monitor your navigation directly from your mobile phone."
    }
   ],
