 "press_quotes": [
  {
   "quote": "The true luxury of this 55 is that each guest can find their own private spot to stop and admire the view, to sit back, relax, and enjoy the cruise.  Starting with the cockpit, with a surface area of 25 square meters, furnished with raised sun loungers.",
   "source": "VELA E MOTORE"
  },
  {
   "quote": "If the philosophy remains the same, ‘crossing oceans in comfort and serenity,’ the methods put in place and the end result are of an entirely new dimension.  At the border between cruising and yachting, the Lagoon 55 does it all and shines.",
   "source": "FIGARO NAUTISME"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The Lagoon 55 marks the continuing renewal of the line.  Note the nod to the first boat produced by the shipyard in 1987:  a Lagoon 55  that was designed by VPLP.  Decidedly, this new model is marked by history.",
   "source": "VOILE MAGAZINE"
  },
  {
   "quote": "From their position to starboard, the person at the helm has a very good 270° view for manoeuvring off the pontoon and leaving harbour. At the foot of the mast, which has been moved aft in keeping with current trends, all sailing manoeuvres are carried out using three winches. The mainsail is hoisted and the self-tacking genoa unfurled with ease, by a single crewmember.",
   "source": "YACHTING WORLD"
  },
  {
   "quote": "When it comes to luxurious and high-performance catamaran yachts, the Lagoon 55 Catamaran stands as a true icon in the world of sailing. Designed with a perfect balance of space, comfort, and advanced technology, this sailing yacht offers an unparalleled blend of elegance and seaworthiness.",
   "source": "OUR YACHT WORLD"
  }
 ]
